---
description: Styling rules (Tailwind design tokens only, class ordering)
globs: ["src/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Full rule: see `AGENTS.md` § Styling Tokens.

- Use design tokens from the `@theme` block in `src/index.css` — no arbitrary values.
- No inline `style={{}}`. Class order: layout → display → text → effects → state
  (Prettier's Tailwind plugin auto-orders on format).
- Re-skin a project by editing tokens in `src/index.css`, never by hardcoding in components.
